# WP Hub Pro — Stripe agent

- **Client:** publishable key only — `sites/wphubpro/src/lib/stripe-loader.ts`. No secret keys in app source.
- **Server:** `functions/stripe-api/` — webhooks and billing logic; calls via `executeFunction` → `APPWRITE_FUNCTION_IDS.STRIPE_API`.
- Follow Stripe best practices; never commit webhook secrets or restricted keys.
